# Secrets backups. A file literally named `backup_.env.local` was once staged
# for commit by accident — these patterns catch the common variations so real
# credentials can never be pushed. Keep secret backups OUTSIDE the repo (a
# password manager is the right place), not in a differently-named copy here.
*.env.local
*env.local*
backup_*
*secrets*
*.pem
*.key
